WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.734 --> 00:00:25.983
"You've come alive with the other statues in the moonlight," Mabel gently explained to Kathleen.

2
00:00:25.984 --> 00:00:30.390
"Why aren't you afraid of me?" asked Kathleen.

3
00:00:30.391 --> 00:00:33.118
"I have the ring," said Mabel.

4
00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:36.561
"Maybe we can find out more about this magic place.

5
00:00:36.562 --> 00:00:40.791
That is, if the other statues will talk to us."

6
00:00:40.792 --> 00:00:44.724
"Apollo was very nice," said Kathleen.

7
00:00:44.725 --> 00:00:48.858
"He's swimming in the lake now."

8
00:00:48.859 --> 00:00:57.255
The girls walked to the lake and sat on the grass to wait for Apollo.

9
00:00:57.256 --> 00:01:02.335
"Hello, little sister," said Apollo, emerging from the lake.

10
00:01:02.336 --> 00:01:05.952
"Who's your friend?"

11
00:01:05.953 --> 00:01:10.139
"This is Mabel," said Kathleen.

12
00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:15.624
"How can you see us, and why aren't you afraid?" asked Apollo.

13
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.502
Mabel showed him the ring.

14
00:01:18.503 --> 00:01:19.875
"Now I understand.

15
00:01:19.876 --> 00:01:23.851
You should become a statue and swim with us."

16
00:01:23.852 --> 00:01:27.053
"I can't swim," said Mabel.

17
00:01:27.054 --> 00:01:31.007
"Me neither," said Kathleen.

18
00:01:31.008 --> 00:01:35.809
"You can swim," Apollo said to Kathleen.

19
00:01:35.810 --> 00:01:40.154
"All statues that come to life are excellent swimmers."

20
00:01:40.155 --> 00:01:44.482
Again he urged Mabel to become a statue.

21
00:01:44.483 --> 00:01:48.064
"This ring . . . ," she said hesitantly.

22
00:01:48.065 --> 00:01:52.850
"You wish for things and you never know how long they'll last."

23
00:01:52.851 --> 00:01:58.389
Apollo explained that she must set a time limit on the ring's powers.

24
00:01:58.390 --> 00:02:03.842
"We'll swim to the island and feast with the gods," he said.

25
00:02:03.843 --> 00:02:10.327
"Oh, I'm so hungry!" said Kathleen. "Do it, Mabel!"

26
00:02:10.328 --> 00:02:14.569
So Mabel decided to become a statue.

27
00:02:14.570 --> 00:02:18.574
First she removed her shoes and stockings.

28
00:02:18.575 --> 00:02:22.189
She didn't think they'd look nice in marble!

29
00:02:22.190 --> 00:02:28.217
Then she said, "I wish I could be a statue of living marble until dawn.

30
00:02:28.218 --> 00:02:32.724
After that I want to return to normal."

31
00:02:32.725 --> 00:02:35.198
Mabel turned into a statue.

32
00:02:35.199 --> 00:02:39.347
Apollo and the girls ran to the lake and jumped in.

33
00:02:39.348 --> 00:02:44.846
The girls were delighted that they could swim with ease.

34
00:02:44.847 --> 00:02:49.260
When they reached the island, Apollo led them to a pool.

35
00:02:49.261 --> 00:02:53.831
All around the pool were statues of gods and goddesses.

36
00:02:53.832 --> 00:02:56.153
And they were all alive.

37
00:02:56.154 --> 00:02:59.384
Some were dancing.

38
00:02:59.385 --> 00:03:03.562
Some were splashing their feet in the pool.

39
00:03:03.563 --> 00:03:06.977
Apollo introduced the girls.

40
00:03:06.978 --> 00:03:11.973
A goddess placed a wreath on everyone's head.

41
00:03:11.974 --> 00:03:14.860
Then the feast began.

42
00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:23.351
A young woman named Psyche handed them ripe pomegranates.

43
00:03:23.352 --> 00:03:27.322
"I wish the boys were here!" Kathleen said.

44
00:03:27.323 --> 00:03:30.990
"I wonder what they're doing," said Mabel.

45
00:03:30.991 --> 00:03:34.160
Hermes landed on the grass.

46
00:03:34.161 --> 00:03:38.642
"They climbed out a window, and now they're looking for you."

47
00:03:38.643 --> 00:03:42.734
"It's easy to wish them here," said Apollo.

48
00:03:42.735 --> 00:03:46.374
Kathleen took the ring.

49
00:03:46.375 --> 00:03:51.432
"I wish the boys could be statues of living marble until dawn.

50
00:03:51.433 --> 00:03:56.259
Afterward I want them to return to normal."

51
00:03:56.260 --> 00:04:00.356
"You should have wished them here," said Apollo.

52
00:04:00.357 --> 00:04:04.872
"But Hermes will fetch them and explain everything to them."

53
00:04:04.873 --> 00:04:06.917
He held up the ring.

54
00:04:06.918 --> 00:04:10.042
"The ring is the heart of the magic."

55
00:04:10.043 --> 00:04:14.089
Then he gave the ring back to Kathleen.

56
00:04:14.090 --> 00:04:20.710
"We don't usually question guests," said Hera, the queen of the gods.

57
00:04:20.711 --> 00:04:23.581
"But everyone is interested in your ring.

58
00:04:23.582 --> 00:04:25.839
How did you get it?"

59
00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:28.881
Just then the boys arrived.

60
00:04:28.882 --> 00:04:33.523
They hugged the girls.

61
00:04:33.524 --> 00:04:40.184
They feasted. Then Mabel told the story of the ring.

62
00:04:40.185 --> 00:04:44.609
"How do you come alive?" Gerald asked Apollo.

63
00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:49.278
"All statues can do it in the moonlight," said Apollo.

64
00:04:49.279 --> 00:04:52.309
"You've seen us because you wore the ring.

65
00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:58.025
But on one night of the year, anyone can see us in certain temples.

66
00:04:58.026 --> 00:05:02.846
One of those temples is in this great garden."

67
00:05:02.847 --> 00:05:06.726
Then Apollo picked up a lyre.

68
00:05:06.727 --> 00:05:11.236
Kathleen leaned against Psyche as Apollo played.

69
00:05:11.237 --> 00:05:18.837
The music was so beautiful that everyone felt at peace.

70
00:05:18.838 --> 00:05:22.955
Then suddenly Apollo cried, "Dawn is coming!

71
00:05:22.956 --> 00:05:26.893
To your pedestals!"

72
00:05:26.894 --> 00:05:31.647
The gods leaped up and ran away.

73
00:05:31.648 --> 00:05:37.402
"What's the secret of the ring?" Mabel called after them.

74
00:05:37.403 --> 00:05:41.057
"Ask at the Temple of Strange Stones in five days,"

75
00:05:41.058 --> 00:05:47.879
said Hermes as he flew away.
